  "title": {
    "zh": "客户专享DIY帐篷堡垒拼搭套装",
    "en": "Customer-exclusive DIY Fort Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向客户专享渠道的DIY帐篷堡垒拼搭套装，适用于家庭互动、课程活动和创意空间搭建，支持多规格组合。\n\n产品材质为塑料/塑胶，含外观设计相关专利字段，产地东莞茶山，适合按渠道需求进行规格分层供货。",
    "en": "This is a customer-exclusive DIY fort building set designed for family interaction, activity classes, and creative space setup, with multiple specification options.\n\nMaterial: plastic. It includes appearance-design patent information and is produced in Chashan, Dongguan, suitable for tiered channel supply by specification."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款客户专享DIY帐篷堡垒拼搭套装采用插珠式结构，可搭建帐篷、堡垒和互动游戏空间，适合儿童创意拼搭场景。",
      "产品提供多档体积、尺寸与重量参数，便于渠道根据价格带和玩法定位配置不同SKU。材质为塑料/塑胶，支持重复拆装和组合重构。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，规格详情可咨询客服，适用于电商上架、跨境分销和项目型采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This customer-exclusive DIY fort set uses a bead-based structure to build tents, forts, and interactive play spaces for children’s creative construction scenarios.",
      "Multiple volume, size, and weight options are provided so channels can configure different SKUs by pricing tier and play positioning. The plastic material supports repeated assembly and reconfiguration.",
      "The item is packed in a color box and detailed variant specifications are available via customer service, suitable for e-commerce listing, cross-border distribution, and project procurement."
    ]
  },
